      "content": "<h3>Creating a TreeSet: four constructors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new TreeSet&lt;&gt;()</code>: natural ordering of the elements.</li>\n<li><code>new TreeSet&lt;&gt;(Comparator c)</code>: your own ordering.</li>\n<li><code>new TreeSet&lt;&gt;(Collection c)</code>: copy with natural ordering, duplicates dropped.</li>\n<li><code>new TreeSet&lt;&gt;(SortedSet s)</code>: copy that keeps the ordering of s.</li>\n</ul>",
